<Basic title="The Bell Season VII">

    <h1>Rules</h1>
    <p>These rules are subject to change at any time. Please check back for updates.</p>
    <br>

    <p>Java Edition Minecraft is required for all operating systems. Bedrock is NOT supported.</p>

    <br>

        <li>No cheating, hacking, or exploiting bugs</li>
        <li>No griefing or stealing from other players</li>
        <li>No spamming or advertising in chat</li>
        <li>No offensive language or behavior</li>
        <li>No sharing personal information of others without consent</li>
        <li>No chunk loaders or intentional chunk loading other than those around the player</li>
        <li>No sharing of server joining information without administrator permission, including but not limited to IP addresses, port numbers, modpack, domains, and more</li>
        <li>No explosive weapons (block breaking) within range of other players or their builds</li>
        <li>Do not build machines or builds intentionally designed to lag the server</li>
        <li>Do not build excessively large machines that may lag the server</li>
        <li>All farms (any block, item, or otherwise material generating machine) located in spawn chunks must be approved by an administrator and must be equipped with an admin approved threshold switch</li>

</Basic>